		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://rodyne.com/?p=3918</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[I am in no particular rush to finish my next novel, the timeline is this year, but it is not as if I have hoards of fans clamoring for it, so it will come when it is good and ready. &#8230; <a href="https://rodyne.com/?p=3918">Continue reading <span class="meta-nav">&#8594;</span></a>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://ko-fi.com/s/22d8cc6d97" target="_blank" rel=" noreferrer noopener"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="745" height="1024" src="https://rodyne.com/wp-content/uploads/Cover3-small-free.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-3919" srcset="https://rodyne.com/wp-content/uploads/Cover3-small-free.jpg 745w, https://rodyne.com/wp-content/uploads/Cover3-small-free-218x300.jpg 218w" sizes="(max-width: 745px) 100vw, 745px" /></a></figure>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I am in no particular rush to finish my next novel, the timeline is this year, but it is not as if I have hoards of fans clamoring for it, so it will come when it is good and ready.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I am also well past the stage of doing this for money or fame, and in order to put things right with the world I am making my last novel A Level of Consciousness free to read. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Again there are no catches, you do not have to sign up for anything, you do not have to like and subscribe, and I am not asking for a review, though feel free to share it as I would be a lot happier if there was a bigger audience for my next novel than just my mother.</p>
</div>
</div>



<p class="has-light-gray-background-color has-background wp-block-paragraph">&#8216;A Level of Consciousness&#8217; <em>is a 110,000 word self-contained, and thought provoking techno-thriller set in a world not unlike our own.</em> <em>It is a story about a witch who was not a witch, and a dragon that was not a dragon. It is a story set in the present day, between how much we know about the universe and how much we still have to learn. It is a story that starts with a friendship and ends with a romance.</em><br /><em>It is however not a story for children, nor is it a story for the faint of heart</em>. <a href="https://rodyne.com/?p=1446">More..</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">You can download the book from Amazon => <a href="https://www.amazon.com/Level-Consciousness-Boz-ebook/dp/B0DN8SK47Y/?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=3otJQ&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.3a079c4e-f938-40c9-a0ed-01ef0e9528e9&amp;pf_rd_p=3a079c4e-f938-40c9-a0ed-01ef0e9528e9&amp;pf_rd_r=146-9353111-5777740&amp;pd_rd_wg=Sk65O&amp;pd_rd_r=3e89b094-635c-40c0-af77-9062ad9902a3" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">here</a>. Please note that amazon sets a minimum price of $0.99 for the eBook, if you do not have a kindle, or are more technically inclined then use the link here => <a href="https://ko-fi.com/s/22d8cc6d97">https://ko-fi.com/s/22d8cc6d97</a> </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Note, this link takes you to the buy-me-a-coffee site where you can downloads the book with an option to donate &#8211; The donate bit is <span style="text-decoration: underline;">completely optional</span>.</p>



<p class="has-light-gray-background-color has-background wp-block-paragraph"><em>You should save the ePub file somewhere on your computer, but unless you have an eReader program installed like <a href="https://calibre-ebook.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Calibre</a>, you wont be able to view the book, and will need to transfer it to your eReader manually. For Amazon Kindle you just need to email the file as an attachment to your kindles email address (Instructions <a href="https://www.amazon.com/sendtokindle" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">here</a>). I have also found instructions for the <a href="https://help.kobo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360024775093-Add-non-protected-PDF-and-ePub-files-to-your-Kobo-eReader-using-your-computer" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Kobo</a> and the <a href="https://help.barnesandnoble.com/hc/en-us/articles/5598405156891-NOOK-Reading-App-for-Windows-Importing-PDF-or-ePub-files" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Nook</a> but I am sure one of the many AI’s out there can explain how to do it much better than me.</em></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Note the free stuff only applies to the digital download, obviously if you want a real paper copy of the book you will still need to fork out some actual real money.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
